unfortunately some of these parameters such as point shapes lack
consistency in R. ggplot2 goes one step in organising them with with
solid vs hollow, but I don't see how your suggestion could be applied
without hard-coding many special cases (e.g. what if a geom_point
layer has a mixture of pch = 1, 19, 21).

